Create a new Flutter application.
Import the Material Design package.
Define the main() function and call runApp().
Create a class named MyApp using StatelessWidget.
Use MaterialApp, Scaffold and AppBar to create the application screen.
Create three food cards displaying Burger, Pizza and Sandwich with their prices.
Use LayoutBuilder to detect the available screen width.
If the width is below 600 pixels, display the cards vertically using Column
If the width is 600 pixels or greater, display the cards horizontally using Row.
Run the application and test both mobile and desktop layouts.
